Package: photo-importer
Version: @VERSION@
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, python3-pil
Maintainer: Photo Importer Maintainers <noreply@example.invalid>
Description: Visual photo importer for NAS folders
 GTK3 desktop app that copies photos from a chosen source folder into a
 dated, configurable folder structure on a NAS (default destination:
 /mnt/photo, matching the <year>/<month>-<day>/<category>/<filename>
 convention already in use there).
